        "type": "paragraph",
        "html": "Calder Rhys. Thirty-two. Alpha. The photograph was official and therefore a little dishonest: dress uniform, the scar on the jaw newer than any memory Ivo had a right to, the mouth arranged in the expression of a person who expected to be liked. Fourteen years had done what fourteen years do. They had kept the eyes. They had made a weapon out of a boy and then congratulated the weapon for its discipline.",
