        "type": "paragraph",
        "html": "\"I could also request that the canopy relocate.\" The helicopter shuddered through a thermal. Ivo set his palm on the case between his boots — stylus blanks, sample vials, the tea tin he pretended was not a comfort object. \"The Reach will not wait for my personal history to become convenient. Helix will not wait. If I flinch, they will write the flinch into the risk assessment and the next commander will be worse, because he will have been chosen to manage me.\"",
